    <guid isPermaLink="false">68b519c05faf36865967160a</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 01 Sep 2025 08:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>“东堤小筑”（</span><strong><span>Bela Vista Villa</span></strong><span>）又名东堤度假村、迈亚美度假村，它位于香港离岛区的长洲中部，有28幢共计250座平房建筑。由于该度假村邻近风景怡人的东湾泳滩和西博寮海峡，附近还建有长利游乐场及北帝庙游乐场，一直都是来长洲岛度假游客的投宿首选。</span></p><span></span><p><span>谁知从1989年起，这处宁静的度假胜地，竟莫名成了香港著名的“自杀天堂”。30年间有至少26个单元间曾发生过自杀案、近40人非正常死亡，也让这个都市、文艺、爱情片的取景地，成了诸如《幽灵人间》、《阴阳路》、《夜半3点钟》、《怨泊》等惊悚恐怖片的拍摄现场……</span></p><span></span><p><span>在众多死亡案件中，除1989年6月21日发生的第一桩“张慕玲弑子上吊案”外，1999年10月21日发生的“废弃焚化炉藏尸案”，无疑是“东堤小筑”最著名的命案了。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlXLPdTWKFpBYG_Nrzh2ohKnqXzw.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>（柯丹）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgkgLzUwyORGH6BCZPkKy25SQ1Kg.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>（右上角碎石堆就是一处废弃焚化炉）</span></p><span></span><p><img alt="图片" src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9tbWJpei5xcGljLmNuL3N6X21tYml6X2pwZy9mS2ZzZnVsclJEQ0UycHVaNk9PTGtGWFphZ1RVYUtycW5uWmZmYW5CWjR1aWJJb0IzcnhFZmljU1Zkc1NjbUVtYjUxVkNodFB1ODFFN1V4eDNMWDNDWHZBLzY0MD93eF9mbXQ9anBlZyZmcm9tPWFwcG1zZyZ3YXRlcm1hcms9MSZ0cD13ZWJwJnd4ZnJvbT01Jnd4X2xhenk9MQ=="></p><span></span><p><span>（抛尸现场）</span></p><span></span><p><img alt="图片" src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9tbWJpei5xcGljLmNuL3N6X21tYml6X2pwZy9mS2ZzZnVsclJEQ0UycHVaNk9PTGtGWFphZ1RVYUtycUs3cEhybWgxSlRZQmRITzlzNVVKNVZaZmliQjgzTFkzbHBRQ2tFTmlhSVh3alU0WVM4ZVYxQXJnLzY0MD93eF9mbXQ9anBlZyZmcm9tPWFwcG1zZyZ3YXRlcm1hcms9MSZ0cD13ZWJwJnd4ZnJvbT01Jnd4X2xhenk9MQ=="></p><span></span><p><span>（警方从废弃焚化炉中清理出柯丹尸体）</span></p><span></span><p><img alt="图片" src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9tbWJpei5xcGljLmNuL3N6X21tYml6X2pwZy9mS2ZzZnVsclJEQ0UycHVaNk9PTGtGWFphZ1RVYUtycXZBbmJ2aWNHdEFGYkp5aWFlOWZGaklPbE5pYjBRRFVQNUVMc0ZMcGxWNEdCV3d0bEo0U1hPYzZQdy82NDA_d3hfZm10PWpwZWcmZnJvbT1hcHBtc2cmd2F0ZXJtYXJrPTEmdHA9d2VicCZ3eGZyb209NSZ3eF9sYXp5PTE="></p><span></span><p><span>（警方逮捕郑文杰）</span></p><span></span><p><img alt="图片" src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9tbWJpei5xcGljLmNuL3N6X21tYml6X2pwZy9mS2ZzZnVsclJEQ0UycHVaNk9PTGtGWFphZ1RVYUtycUM4NERpYlVhRk9LMUJ1UnlkS2JjaWFVZ041ajJSRUlwenlRSU9FVWs0NHFEUXVKN3BNYlJpYUVOUS82NDA_d3hfZm10PWpwZWcmZnJvbT1hcHBtc2cmd2F0ZXJtYXJrPTEmdHA9d2VicCZ3eGZyb209NSZ3eF9sYXp5PTE="></p><span></span><p><span>（用来遮掩柯丹尸体的两张床垫）</span></p><span></span><p><img alt="图片" src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9tbWJpei5xcGljLmNuL3N6X21tYml6X2pwZy9mS2ZzZnVsclJEQ0UycHVaNk9PTGtGWFphZ1RVYUtycVhGeUx0blFRaERsQll1MDA3UEptclR5aDZMSzhuWnNCYTlLR2dnQkhSSWlhZ1FraHYzZ1d4amcvNjQwP3d4X2ZtdD1qcGVnJmZyb209YXBwbXNnJndhdGVybWFyaz0xJnRwPXdlYnAmd3hmcm9tPTUmd3hfbGF6eT0x"></p><span></span><p><span>（21岁的梁绮华）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fh7tVrJJd7WSrflK67hQnjx2skwg.png"></figure><span></span><p><img alt="图片" src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9tbWJpei5xcGljLmNuL3N6X21tYml6X2pwZy9mS2ZzZnVsclJEQ0UycHVaNk9PTGtGWFphZ1RVYUtycVkzT3hmMnhkbVBVTGpiSmxnWmdraWI1NVl1c3BlT0xIaFU4WERnQUNSZFJRZXNGMkQ1dVZhTGcvNjQwP3d4X2ZtdD1qcGVnJmZyb209YXBwbXNnJndhdGVybWFyaz0xJnRwPXdlYnAmd3hmcm9tPTUmd3hfbGF6eT0x"></p><span></span><p><span>（左为杨嘉仪，右为梁绮华）</span></p><span></span><p><span>————————分割线————————</span></p><span></span><p><span>目前我们的播客内容分为对谈和有声书。</span></p><span></span><p><span>对谈节目因为袜皮个人工作安排和经验原因，制作和更新会比较慢。</span></p><span></span><p><span>同时，我们会更新一些有声书作品，供喜欢这类作品的朋友收听。如果不爱听有声书，大家也可以忽略，等待我们的聊天节目。我们会在节目标题上注明类别。</span></p><span></span><p><span>感谢大家的包容和支持。❤️</span></p><span></span><p><span>【其他平台】</span></p><span></span><p><span>网易云音乐：@没药花园</span></p><span></span><p><span>新浪微博：@没药花园案件</span></p><span></span><p><span>小红书：@没药花园</span></p><span></span><p><span>抖音：@没药花园（悬疑和心理）</span></p><span></span><p><span>公众号：没药花园</span></p><span></span><p><span>有声合作邮箱：JDGShH959@163.com</span></p><span></span><p><span>没药花园有声版作品由辽宁经典音乐广播有声团队荣誉出品，有声书版权受法律保护，任何人不得下载、翻录。</span></p>]]></description>
